{"c":[{"name":"20261015T194919Z-ca5ba2748fcbcd80","text":"Cults updateCreation has no file or image URLs. createBlueprint(creationId, fileUrl) and createIllustration(creationId, imageUrl) add them; destroyBlueprint(id) and destroyIllustration(id) remove them. myself.creationsBatch takes ids. creation() takes a slug.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T004939Z-ba3d20b148e83373","text":"Cults creationsBatch ids matches the slug, not the stored global id. A global id decodes to Creation/<slug>. The returned row id stays the global id.","type":"note"}]}
